{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Problem of Many Things.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Problem of Many Things.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"problem of many things problem of many things","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Problem of Many Things.md","fileName":"Problem of Many Things.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Problem of Many Things","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Responsibility and Explainability]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","Problem of Many Hands","AI Traceability","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Problem of Many Things.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Problem of Many Things.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"problem of many things problem of many things","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Problem of Many Things.md","fileName":"Problem of Many Things.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Problem of Many Things","heading":"Problem of Many Things","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The problem of many things is the difficulty of assigning responsibility when an outcome emerges from interactions among numerous technical components, datasets, devices, and environments. No single part may contain the cause, and changing one component can alter the behavior of the whole arrangement.\n\nThis extends the [[Problem of Many Hands]] from distributed people to distributed material agency. Investigation must follow dependencies across models, sensors, software, and infrastructure. [[AI Traceability]] and system-level testing help reconstruct these interactions, while governance must assign responsibility to the organizations that assemble and operate the overall system.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","Problem of Many Hands","AI Traceability","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Problem of Many Things.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Problem of Many Things.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"problem of many things problem of many things","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Problem of Many Things.md","fileName":"Problem of Many Things.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Problem of Many Things","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","Problem of Many Hands","AI Traceability","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}